{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"opaque","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object CONTRACT.md §23 defines: a registration record and the server-issued","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session handle that identifies the exchange it came from.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OpaqueEnrollment"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The server cannot build this — it never sees the plaintext — so any request that "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"sets"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"password has to carry it: "},{"code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"\/auth\/password\/change","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"\/auth\/reset\/confirm","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"\/admin\/bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note what is ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"text":" here. The SRP enrolment this replaces carried a salt, a group and a full set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of KDF costs, and required the account’s canonical username — passing an email produced a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verifier no login could ever satisfy, and renaming a user invalidated their verifier outright.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A record binds to a credential identifier the server chooses, and the key-stretching parameters","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"tex